| 达人归因成交件数 | `orderUnits` | `order_units` | 11 | 92 | 12 |
| 退款金额 | `refundAmount` | `refund_amount` | 0 | 85.66 | 0 |
| 视频数 | `videoCnt` | `video_cnt` | 10 | 36 | 35 |
| 直播数 | `liveCnt` | `live_cnt` | 2 | 40 | 9 |
| 已发布内容的达人数 | `creatorsPublished` | `creators_published` | 9 | 49 | 26 |
| 动销达人数 | `creatorsSold` | `creators_sold` | 5 | 46 | 5 |
| 预计佣金 | `estCommission` | `est_commission` | 9.69 | 44.91 | 3.73 |
| 窗口文案 | `window` | `window_label` | **近 7 天**（2026/7/29–2026/8/4） | 同左 | 同左 |
